---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} modDatetime={new Date("2026-06-09T00:00:00Z")} structuredData={schemaGraph}>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-center">
    <section class="relative flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#0f172a] pt-20 pb-28 text-white lg:pt-28 lg:pb-36" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.22), transparent 45%), radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.14), transparent 45%);">
      <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-100 shadow-sm">
          <span>Independent Assurance Wireless 2026 Guide • Last updated {displayDate}</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="mx-auto max-w-5xl text-4xl leading-tight font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          Assurance Wireless Free Tablet 2026: <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-300 to-pink-200 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Eligibility & Options</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-4xl text-lg leading-relaxed font-medium text-blue-100 sm:text-xl">
          Assurance Wireless offers Lifeline-supported wireless service on the T-Mobile network for eligible customers. Some users search for an Assurance Wireless free tablet, free phone, or tablet with internet, but device availability depends on ZIP code, state rules, eligibility, provider inventory, plan terms, shipping, activation, and possible co-pay. This guide explains real Assurance Wireless tablet options, EBT/Medicaid eligibility, documents, application steps, BYOP, status tracking, and safer provider comparisons.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-5 sm:flex-row">
          <a href={officialAssuranceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-white shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-blue-500 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-500 sm:w-auto">Apply Now on Official Site</a>
          <a href="/eligibility/" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/30 bg-white/5 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-white backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/10 sm:w-auto">Check Eligibility First</a>
        </div>

        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-blue-200/70">
          FreeTablet.click is independent. We are not Assurance Wireless, T-Mobile, FCC, USAC, Lifeline, or a government agency. We do not approve applications, ship devices, or manage Assurance Wireless accounts.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="quick-answer" class="w-full border-b border-border bg-blue-50/60 py-14">
      <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-blue-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8 lg:p-10">
          <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-blue-600 uppercase">Quick Answer</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">Quick Answer: Does Assurance Wireless Offer Free Tablets in 2026?</h2>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/80">
            <p>Assurance Wireless mainly provides Lifeline-supported phone service for eligible users. Tablet options may be advertised or available in some situations, but an Assurance Wireless free tablet is not guaranteed for every applicant. Availability depends on ZIP code, state rules, eligibility, provider inventory, current plan terms, shipping, activation, and possible co-pay.</p>
            <p>Always check the official Assurance Wireless site before submitting personal information. You can also review <a href="/eligibility/" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">Assurance Wireless eligibility</a>, learn <a href="/how-to-apply/" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">how to apply for a free tablet</a>, <a href="/states/" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">check tablet availability by state</a>, compare the <a href="/" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">free government tablet guide</a>, <a href="/airtalk-wireless/" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">compare AirTalk Wireless tablet options</a>, <a href="/safelink-wireless/" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">compare SafeLink Wireless options</a>, and <a href="/standup-wireless/" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">compare StandUp Wireless</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="quick-facts" class="w-full bg-muted/30 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mb-10 text-center">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">Assurance Wireless Quick Facts</h2>
          <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">A factual snapshot without fake ratings, fake reviews, or guaranteed tablet claims.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white shadow-sm">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-border">
              {quickFacts.map((fact) => (
                <tr>
                  <th class="w-1/3 bg-muted/40 px-5 py-4 font-bold text-foreground">{fact.label}</th>
                  <td class="px-5 py-4 leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">{fact.value}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="legit" class="w-full border-t border-border bg-white py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-8">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-blue-600 uppercase">Legitimacy check</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">Is Assurance Wireless Legit?</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">Assurance Wireless is a real Lifeline-supported wireless provider, associated with T-Mobile network service. Users should still apply only through the official Assurance Wireless site, verify the URL, read terms, and avoid fake pages promising guaranteed free tablets, guaranteed premium phones, or instant approval.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-5 lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted/30 p-6"><h3 class="font-bold text-foreground">Use official pages only</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">Start with the <a href={officialAssuranceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">Assurance Wireless official website</a> and avoid lookalike pages, social ads, or forms promising guaranteed tablets.</p></div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted/30 p-6"><h3 class="font-bold text-foreground">Verify Lifeline eligibility</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">Lifeline eligibility may be based on income or qualifying programs. Most states use National Verifier handling, while Texas and Oregon may have special eligibility processes.</p></div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted/30 p-6"><h3 class="font-bold text-foreground">Avoid guarantee claims</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">Be careful with “free tablet guaranteed,” “premium phone guaranteed,” “nationwide availability,” or “instant approval” language unless the current official terms clearly support it.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="tablet-options" class="w-full border-y border-border bg-slate-50 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mx-auto mb-12 max-w-3xl text-center">
          <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-blue-600 uppercase">Tablets and devices</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">Does Assurance Wireless Offer Tablets?</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">Assurance Wireless is more commonly known for Lifeline phone service. Tablet offers may vary and are not guaranteed. If a tablet option appears, review the device model, data plan, co-pay, shipping, activation, warranty, return policy, and state availability before applying.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          {tabletCards.map((card) => <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">{card.title}</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">{card.body}</p></div>)}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="phone-tablet-byop" class="w-full bg-white py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
